---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Temporary Works Consulting & Design Ltd — an independent UK engineering practice focused on temporary works.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>An independent practice, focused on temporary works.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Temporary Works Consulting &amp; Design Ltd is a UK engineering practice working
        with main contractors, sub-contractors, principal designers and PCs across the
        United Kingdom.
      </p>

      <h2>Why &ldquo;independent&rdquo; matters.</h2>
      <p>
        Temporary works failures tend to come from concurrent pressures — programme, ground
        conditions, change. An independent design checker is paid to ask the awkward question
        before the awkward thing happens on site.
      </p>

      <h2>Standards we work to.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>BS 5975 — Code of practice for temporary works procedures.</li>
        <li>BS EN 12812 — Falsework: performance requirements and general design.</li>
        <li>BS EN 12811 — Temporary works equipment (scaffolds and access).</li>
        <li>BS EN 1991 (Eurocode 1) — Actions on structures, including wind (Part 1-4).</li>
        <li>BS EN 1993 (Eurocode 3) — Design of steel structures.</li>
        <li>BS EN 1992 (Eurocode 2) — Design of concrete structures.</li>
        <li>BRE 470 — Working platforms for tracked plant.</li>
        <li>NASC TG20:21 &amp; TG30:24 — Scaffold compliance guidance.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Company details.</h2>
      <p>
        Temporary Works Consulting &amp; Design Ltd is a private limited company,
        registered in England and Wales (company number <strong>17198188</strong>),
        incorporated 5 May 2026 under the Companies Act 2006.
      </p>

      <h2>Insurances and accreditations.</h2>
      <p>
        Professional indemnity and public liability insured. Happy to share certificates on
        request.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow { max-width: 760px; }
</style>
